02:36:31,170 --> 02:36:36,838
But neither of these approaches is the most efficient way of doing this. Here lies

1922
02:36:36,838 --> 02:36:42,644
the second advantage of NumPy arrays, their broadcasting functionality. NumPy arrays

1923
02:36:42,644 --> 02:36:48,104
vectorize operations so that they are performed on all elements of an object at

1924
02:36:48,104 --> 02:36:53,841
