1948
02:38:55,751 --> 02:39:01,251
performance. By gathering and analyzing runtimes, we can be sure to implement the

1949
02:39:01,251 --> 02:39:06,682
code that is fastest and thus more efficient. To compare runtimes, we need to be

1950
02:39:06,682 --> 02:39:09,330
able to compute the runtime for a line,

1951
02:39:09,330 --> 02:39:14,792
or multiple lines of code. IPython comes with some handy built-in magic commands we

