02:41:15,367 --> 02:41:21,915
times in order to estimate runtime. Two runs, each with 10 executions. Another cool

1977
02:41:21,915 --> 02:41:28,305
feature of TimeIt is its ability to run on single or multiple lines of code. When

1978
02:41:28,305 --> 02:41:30,830
using TimeIt in line magic mode,

1979
02:41:30,830 --> 02:41:36,612
or with a single line of code, one percentage sign is used. Similarly, we can run

1980
02:41:36,612 --> 02:41:42,608
timeit in cell magic mode, or provide multiple lines of code by using two percentage

1981
02:41:42,608 --> 02:41:48,533
signs. We can save the output of timeit into a variable using the dash o flag. This

1982
02:41:48,533 --> 02:41:54,387
