02:42:30,503 --> 02:42:35,892
the literal syntax, we could save the output of the individual timeit commands as

1991
02:42:35,892 --> 02:42:41,282
shown here. Then, we could compare the two outputs. For simplicity, let's look at

1992
02:42:41,282 --> 02:42:46,671
just the output of both the timeit commands to see which was faster. Here, we can

1993
02:42:46,671 --> 02:42:52,194
