02:51:05,343 --> 02:51:11,381
may not show up when using mprun, and that is a perfectly fine result. The random

2086
02:51:11,381 --> 02:51:17,642
sample of 35,000 heroes was used solely to show typical mprun output when the memory

2087
02:51:17,642 --> 02:51:23,606
was large enough to report. Finally, the memory profiler package inspects memory

2088
02:51:23,606 --> 02:51:26,960
consumption by querying the operating system.

2089
02:51:26,960 --> 02:51:32,257
This might be slightly different from the amount of memory that is actually used by

2090
02:51:32,257 --> 02:51:37,553
the Python interpreter. Thus, results may differ between platforms and even between

2091
02:51:37,553 --> 02:51:42,786
runs. Regardless, the important information can still be observed. Now that you've

2092
02:51:42,786 --> 02:51:47,891
got the tools to evaluate memory consumption, put your skills to the test. Let's

