06:11:43,842 --> 06:11:48,586
code to execute if the condition is true. Optionally, you can have an else

4629
06:11:48,586 --> 06:11:53,780
statement, which executes if the condition specified is not true. You finish with

4630
06:11:53,780 --> 06:11:58,652
