we use the client's download file method. We pass the file name or the local path we

6998
09:05:45,299 --> 09:05:50,665
want the file to download to. Then we specify the bucket and key of the object we

6999
09:05:50,665 --> 09:05:56,030
want to download. Sometimes an object has outlived its usefulness and needs to be

7000
09:05:56,030 --> 09:05:56,560
deleted.

