variable name Voter underscore DF. Once created, we want to do two further

10070
13:11:38,202 --> 13:11:42,672
operations. The first is to create a full year column by using a two-digit year

10071
13:11:42,672 --> 13:11:47,425
present in the data set and adding 2000 to each entry. This does not actually change

10072
13:11:47,425 --> 13:11:48,670
