15:06:08,860 --> 15:06:14,638
We can also exclude these results by using the negative form of the like operator.

11520
15:06:14,638 --> 15:06:20,274
In doing this, we get one contact number that doesn't start with 555. Now, let's

11521
15:06:20,274 --> 15:06:25,770
choose the brackets to specify ranges. In this example, we are filtering those

11522
15:06:25,770 --> 15:06:31,689
