15:17:46,420 --> 15:17:52,468
We will practice the concepts related to error handling with a dataset based on an

11662
15:17:52,468 --> 15:17:58,221
electric bike store. It contains information about products, buyers, staff and

11663
15:17:58,221 --> 15:18:04,195
orders. Let's start with an example where an error occurs. In the products table,

11664
15:18:04,195 --> 15:18:10,317
there is a Trek Powerfly 5 2018 bicycle. In this table, there is a constraint which

11665
15:18:10,317 --> 15:18:13,710
