11724
15:22:52,195 --> 15:22:53,620
considered as warnings.

11725
15:22:53,620 --> 15:22:58,927
Errors with severity from 11 to 19 are cuttable. Errors with a severity of 20 or

11726
15:22:58,927 --> 15:23:04,432
higher aren't caught either if they stop the connection. However, if the connection

11727
15:23:04,432 --> 15:23:10,004
is not stopped, the try-cut will cut the error. And finally, compilation errors. For

11728
15:23:10,004 --> 15:23:15,444
example, if we write the name of a table that doesn't exist. Let's see one example

11729
15:23:15,444 --> 15:23:17,500
