12366
16:17:01,170 --> 16:17:07,307
Regular stored procedures allow input parameters, transaction statements, and the

12367
16:17:07,307 --> 16:17:13,445
possibility to return output. These considerations impact the real-life use cases

12368
16:17:13,445 --> 16:17:19,809
