13544
17:49:16,700 --> 17:49:22,278
MongoDB also supports some types native to Python but not to JSON. Two examples are

13545
17:49:22,278 --> 17:49:27,722
dates and regular expressions. Let's make concrete how JSON maps to Python and in

13546
17:49:27,722 --> 17:49:33,233
turn to MongoDB. Here is how I accessed the Nobel Prize API and collected its data

13547
17:49:33,233 --> 17:49:38,811
