I'll be sure to fold in some of what you learned before. Congratulations on

14135
18:34:25,776 --> 18:34:30,451
completing this course! You now know how to work with MongoDB databases and

14136
18:34:30,451 --> 18:34:35,564
collections. You've created and composed query filters with operators. You've used

14137
18:34:35,564 --> 18:34:40,738
dot notation to query substructure. You've fetched distinct values, queried arrays,

14138
18:34:40,738 --> 18:34:45,601
and used regular expressions. You've projected, sorted, and ensured performant

14139
18:34:45,601 --> 18:34:46,910
queries with indexes.

14140
18:34:46,910 --> 18:34:51,799
And finally, you've constructed aggregation pipelines for flexible and powerful

14141
18:34:51,799 --> 18:34:56,936
analyses. You now have the vocabulary and experience you need to resolve issues you

14142
